WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,230 --> 00:00:02,390
Go back and tell Su Weiwei

2
00:00:02,390 --> 00:00:03,950
I want someone who can work

3
00:00:03,950 --> 00:00:05,310
Come and bask in the sun

4
00:00:05,310 --> 00:00:06,390
No food to eat

5
00:00:06,390 --> 00:00:14,220
She agreed. She agreed.

6
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:15,970
Send one person every day

7
00:00:15,970 --> 00:00:17,610
Go on the same day, return on the same day

8
00:00:17,970 --> 00:00:19,130
Rewards are calculated in the dark

9
00:00:20,250 --> 00:00:21,650
What about the specific remuneration?

10
00:00:22,260 --> 00:00:23,380
No guaranteed resources

11
00:00:23,660 --> 00:00:25,300
Well done, meat and vegetables

12
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:27,220
If you don't do it well, you won't get anything.

13
00:00:27,580 --> 00:00:29,580
That's not the whole people, he just opens his mouth

14
00:00:29,580 --> 00:00:30,740
Now on this island

15
00:00:30,740 --> 00:00:33,600
It was him who had the final say, otherwise

16
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:35,320
We can only trade with Jiang Yue

17
00:00:35,640 --> 00:00:36,600
But where is Jiang Yue?

18
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:37,680
but no food

19
00:00:37,680 --> 00:00:38,640
Since we are talking

20
00:00:38,640 --> 00:00:40,120
Why don't you give him the lowest number?

21
00:00:40,520 --> 00:00:43,820
He didn't even give him the chance to bargain.

22
00:00:43,820 --> 00:00:45,020
Just follow his rules

23
00:00:45,020 --> 00:00:50,520
Then who will go next?

24
00:00:50,720 --> 00:00:51,680
All mute

25
00:00:53,180 --> 00:00:54,580
It will be decided by drawing lots tomorrow morning

26
00:00:54,940 --> 00:00:57,760
Let's all go back to sleep and draw lots.

27
00:00:58,200 --> 00:01:02,520
The person who is drawn will work hard all day to bring back the resources

28
00:01:02,520 --> 00:01:03,520
1st grade for everyone

29
00:01:03,520 --> 00:01:04,680
A pure and innocent person

30
00:01:05,040 --> 00:01:07,610
This system is just a tower in the sky and unrealistic

31
00:01:08,300 --> 00:01:09,420
What do you think?

32
00:01:10,540 --> 00:01:12,420
You'll know tomorrow morning
